This product uses data and services from:

- GWES Central Alert Repository
  Global Weather & EAS Society, LLC
  https://alerts.globaleas.org
  https://alerts.globaleas.org/swagger/
  Public API, no key required. Used under their public terms.

- National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA) / National Weather Service
  CAP feeds via https://alerts.weather.gov and https://api.weather.gov
  Radar imagery via https://radar.weather.gov
  Public domain U.S. government works.

The dashboard also loads these third-party libraries and assets from public CDNs:

- Leaflet 1.9.4 (BSD 2-Clause License) - https://leafletjs.com
- Inter and Share Tech Mono fonts via Google Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)

Requests to these services include a descriptive User-Agent identifying this project
(EASRepository/1.0 + repository URL).

